WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.625
So, the decisions.

2
00:00:01.625 --> 00:00:04.342
The CIO and data
leadership hold the order,

3
00:00:04.342 --> 00:00:09.000
give every instance a verdict and a
target, upgrade or retire old engines,

4
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:13.580
set no retirement date for the old
certificate authority until SQL

5
00:00:13.580 --> 00:00:17.850
Server's certificates have moved,
and declare closure on evidence.

6
00:00:17.850 --> 00:00:21.900
The CISO sets the standard and
reviews Azure roles like sysadmin.

7
00:00:21.900 --> 00:00:26.325
Server infrastructure onboards
Arc now, on domain-joined hosts.

8
00:00:26.325 --> 00:00:30.875
Application and data owners approve
their access rules and their cutovers.

9
00:00:30.875 --> 00:00:35.750
The authorizing official accepts the
leveraged services and every exception.

10
00:00:35.750 --> 00:00:39.100
And the NTLM program
decides the long tail.

11
00:00:39.100 --> 00:00:40.963
None of this waits on a purchase.

12
00:00:40.963 --> 00:00:42.625
Count the estate first.

13
00:00:42.625 --> 00:00:46.550
Data Platform has the detail,
every claim footnoted.

14
00:00:46.550 --> 00:00:47.380
Thank you.
